      "body": "## Purpose\n\nSince #56560, `EmulationMxfp8LinearKernel` dequantizes MXFP8 weights to BF16 once at load time, but `apply_weights` still calls `F.linear` directly. That skips the platform's unquantized-GEMM dispatch, which a BF16 checkpoint of the same layer would use.\n\nOn ROCm, that dispatch (`rocm_unquantized_gemm`) picks the skinny wvSplitK / LLMM1 kernels at decode batch sizes, while `F.linear` runs the 1-row GEMM on large hipBLASLt tiles. This PR calls `dispatch_unquantized_gemm()` instead. On CUDA and XPU the dispatcher returns `F.linear` for the default backend, so nothing changes there.\n\nThis affects every MXFP8 linear on ROCm GPUs without native MX (all but gfx95x), for example the DeepSeek-V4.1 attention and shared-expert linears.\n\n## Duplicate-work check\n\n- #56751 (closed) added a skinny dispatch table for DeepSeek-V4.1 on SM100 only.\n- #48427 and #59782 / #60169 / #60384 / #62088 add requantized or native MXFP8 paths on CDNA; none changes the emulation path.\n- #51511 proposes disabling skinny GEMM on gfx1151. The results below are on gfx1151 with skinny GEMM on, and the output matches `F.linear`.\n\n## Test Plan\n\n```\npytest tests/kernels/quantization/test_mxfp8_emulation_linear.py\n```\n\nThe new test checks that the output matches `F.linear` on the dequantized weight for the DeepSeek-V4.1 shapes at TP=4 and 1-256 tokens, which covers the wvSplitK, LLMM1 and hipBLASLt branches.\n\nEnd-to-end: `deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017` on 4x Strix Halo (gfx1151), TP=4 over Ray, llama-benchy pp2048 / tg128, mirrored A B B A in one server instance.\n\n## Test Result\n\n```\ntest_mxfp8_emulation_linear.py   36 passed   (gfx1151)\n```\n\n| | main | this PR |\n|---|--:|--:|\n| decode tok/s (tg128) | 6.87 | 8.85 (+29%) |\n| prefill tok/s (pp2048) | 93.5 | 93.7 |\n\nGSM8K (first 25) with this PR: 25/25.\n\nPer-shape latency at 1 token, weights rotated through 128 MB so each call reads from DRAM as in decode (median of 5 windows; 2 and 4 tokens are within 10%):\n\n| linear (TP=4) | N x K | main | this PR | |\n|---|---|--:|--:|--:|\n| fused wq_a + wkv | 1792 x 5120 | 182 us | 83 us | 2.2x |\n| wq_b | 8192 x 1280 | 117 us | 90 us | 1.3x |\n| wo_a | 2048 x 4096 | 248 us | 89 us | 2.8x |\n| wo_b | 5120 x 2048 | 430 us | 110 us | 3.9x |\n| shared expert gate_up | 1152 x 5120 | 171 us | 55 us | 3.1x |\n| shared expert down | 5120 x 576 | 38 us | 28 us | 1.4x |\n\n## AI assistance\n\nAI assistance was used for this change. The submitting human has reviewed every changed line and ran the tests reported above.\n",
